WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:21,660
Is there a rife setting for someone who lost their sense of smell from COVID about a year ago? Well, there's a rife, there's a COVID long call program, I would try that one.

00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:25,660
The COVID long hauler, I think it's called.

00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:29,660
That's the one I would use.

00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:47,150
I don't think there's another program for loss of smell. You'd have to look it up. I don't think there is. I would do the COVID long haul program.

